    <div class="progesterone__grid">
      <div class="progesterone__img">
        <img src="https://malmohealth.com/images/4asdf.webp" alt="Smiling woman"/>
      </div>
      <div class="progesterone__content">
        <h2>Do you need <span class="gradient-text">Progesterone</span> too</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">If you still have a uterus and you're taking systemic estrogen, progesterone is prescribed as well to help protect your uterine lining. We make it easy — oral progesterone is added for free to your treatment plan during your initial intake.</p>

        <div class="prog-benefit">
          <div class="prog-benefit__header">
            <h3 class="prog-benefit__title">Balanced hormone delivery</h3>
            <span class="prog-benefit__icon">♀</span>
          </div>
          <p class="prog-benefit__text">Estrogen alone can thicken the uterine lining over time, increasing your risk of endometrial cancer. Progesterone helps keep things balanced.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-benefit">
          <div class="prog-benefit__header">
            <h3 class="prog-benefit__title">Supports better sleep</h3>
            <span class="prog-benefit__icon">🌙</span>
          </div>
          <p class="prog-benefit__text">Many people find progesterone has a calming effect and helps improve sleep quality.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-benefit">
          <div class="prog-benefit__header">
            <h3 class="prog-benefit__title">Eases anxiety + mood swings</h3>
            <span class="prog-benefit__icon">🧠</span>
          </div>
          <p class="prog-benefit__text">It can help smooth out emotional ups and downs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-benefit">
          <div class="prog-benefit__header">
            <h3 class="prog-benefit__title">Whole-hormone harmony</h3>
            <span class="prog-benefit__icon">☯</span>
          </div>
          <p class="prog-benefit__text">Estrogen and progesterone work best as a team, especially during menopause.</p>
        </div>

        <a href="/legal/hormone-replacement-safety" class="btn btn--primary" style="align-self:flex-start;">Safety information <span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a>
