<!-- STAT SECTION -->
<section class="stat-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stat-grid">
      <div class="stat-content">
        <p class="stat-eyebrow">FDA-approved Bioidentical Treatments</p>
        <h2>Did you know that HRT, when started early in menopause, can reduce all-cause mortality by <span class="gradient-text">almost 40%?*</span></h2>
        <p class="text-muted">Bioidentical HRT isn't just a trend — it's a medically proven solution to help women navigate perimenopause and menopause with more ease and fewer symptoms.</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn--primary" style="align-self:flex-start;">Get Started</a>
        <p class="eyebrow text-muted" style="font-size:0.72rem;">*National Library of Medicine (based on women who started within 10 years of menopause)</p>
      </div>
